--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/70129.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added a ``beacons.status`` execution module function that reports, for each
+configured beacon, the timestamp of its last actual execution and whether
+that execution raised an error. The status reflects live in-process state
+from the running minion's beacon loop, so it is always current and does not
+require reading logs, waiting for a new probe cycle, or restarting the
+minion.
